{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Huh, then you’d be really busy, always having to go drinking."}],"id":"1448346cc09f18b0","jyutping":"haa6，gam2 mai6 hou2 m4 dak1 haan4，seng4 jat6 dou1 jiu3 heoi3 jam2 lo1。","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"吓，噉咪好唔得閒，成日都要去飲囖。","words":[{"jyutping":"haa6","pos":"m","text":"吓"},{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"r","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"mai6","pos":"d","text":"咪"},{"jyutping":"hou2","pos":"d","text":"好"},{"jyutping":"m4","pos":"d","text":"唔"},{"jyutping":"dak1 haan4","pos":"v","text":"得閒"},{"jyutping":"seng4 jat6","pos":"d","text":"成日"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"jiu3","pos":"vu","text":"要"},{"jyutping":"heoi3","pos":"p","text":"去"},{"jyutping":"jam2","pos":"v","text":"飲"},{"jyutping":"lo1","pos":"y","text":"囖"}]}
